00:36:58,670 --> 00:37:01,710
but I have I have slides on it, so I thought it would be fun.

849
00:37:01,710 --> 00:37:03,710
So this is going to be trying to steer models

850
00:37:03,710 --> 00:37:09,350
toward human preferences, so a little like this thing, RLHF.

851
00:37:09,350 --> 00:37:14,190
So what are the great objectives for AI?

852
00:37:14,190 --> 00:37:15,790
This class is almost entirely focused

853
00:37:15,790 --> 00:37:19,330
on just one, which is, given lots of wonderful data,

854
00:37:19,330 --> 00:37:20,590
just imitate it.

855
00:37:20,590 --> 00:37:22,090
So this is supervised learning.

856
00:37:22,090 --> 00:37:25,790
This is generative modeling, maximizing the likelihood

857
00:37:25,790 --> 00:37:29,450
of the data under the model, self-supervised learning,

858
00:37:29,450 --> 00:37:32,190
same thing.

859
00:37:32,190 --> 00:37:33,630
What other objectives could there

860
00:37:33,630 --> 00:37:35,730
