00:41:19,970 --> 00:41:22,268
and then it got replaced by diffusion models.

947
00:41:22,268 --> 00:41:23,810
But it was a pretty cool thing to do,

948
00:41:23,810 --> 00:41:26,050
and it already worked back then.

