972
00:42:21,090 --> 00:42:22,550
I care about all these things.

973
00:42:22,550 --> 00:42:25,270
The general name for the field that studies this

974
00:42:25,270 --> 00:42:27,430
is multi-objective optimization.

975
00:42:27,430 --> 00:42:30,470
And one way of doing it is you just add all your objectives

976
00:42:30,470 --> 00:42:32,470
together, weighted by your--

977
00:42:32,470 --> 00:42:34,820
how much you care about each one.

978
00:42:34,820 --> 00:42:38,700
But sometimes this-- it could be one objective just scaled very

979
00:42:38,700 --> 00:42:40,080
differently than another one.

