985
00:42:50,720 --> 00:42:52,820
I want to find the frontier where

986
00:42:52,820 --> 00:42:56,100
I'm maximizing every objective as much as

987
00:42:56,100 --> 00:42:59,860
possible without trading-- without causing other loss

988
00:42:59,860 --> 00:43:03,560
functions to decrease in their measure.

989
00:43:03,560 --> 00:43:04,420
Yeah.

990
00:43:04,420 --> 00:43:06,660
So multi-objective optimization and Pareto frontier

991
00:43:06,660 --> 00:43:07,960
are some terms to look up.

992
00:43:13,540 --> 00:43:14,580
Right.

993
00:43:14,580 --> 00:43:18,720
That's actually a costly optimization process.

994
00:43:18,720 --> 00:43:21,500
This is test-time compute to solve a problem

995
00:43:21,500 --> 00:43:24,365
